{"seq":3,"slug":"infrastructure-as-code","title":"基础设施即代码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/monitoring-and-operations/infrastructure-as-code","wordCount":988,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"基础设施即代码\">基础设施即代码</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>基础设施即代码（IaC）</strong> 将基础设施的创建、配置与管理编写为可版本化、可审计、可重复执行的代码，其核心价值在于可审计性与可重复性——每次变更都能通过 Git 历史追溯。四条原则：声明式配置、版本控制、幂等性、不可变基础设施。</p>\n<p>代表性工具有三类分工：<strong>Terraform</strong> 以 HCL 声明式创建云资源并管理状态；<strong>Ansible</strong> 通过 SSH 无代理执行服务器配置，与 Terraform 互补；<strong>GitOps</strong> 进一步以 Git 仓库作为唯一真实来源（ArgoCD/Flux 自动同步），实现持续部署与漂移检测。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"iac-核心理念\">IaC 核心理念</h2><p>基础设施即代码（Infrastructure as Code, IaC）是将基础设施的创建、配置和管理过程编写为可版本化、可审计、可重复执行的代码。它消除了手动操作的不确定性，使基础设施变更像应用代码一样经过代码审查和自动化测试。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    CODE[基础设施代码] --&gt;|版本控制| GIT[Git 仓库]&#10;    GIT --&gt;|CI/CD| PLAN[执行计划]&#10;    PLAN --&gt;|审批| APPLY[自动应用]&#10;    APPLY --&gt; INFRA[云基础设施]&#10;    INFRA --&gt;|状态同步| STATE[状态文件]\">graph LR\n    CODE[基础设施代码] --&gt;|版本控制| GIT[Git 仓库]\n    GIT --&gt;|CI/CD| PLAN[执行计划]\n    PLAN --&gt;|审批| APPLY[自动应用]\n    APPLY --&gt; INFRA[云基础设施]\n    INFRA --&gt;|状态同步| STATE[状态文件]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>IaC 原则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>声明式配置</td>\n<td>描述期望状态而非操作步骤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本控制</td>\n<td>所有配置纳入 Git 管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幂等性</td>\n<td>多次执行结果一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可重复性</td>\n<td>同一代码在任何环境产生相同结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可变基础设施</td>\n<td>变更通过替换而非修改实现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> IaC 的最大价值不在于自动化本身，而在于<strong>可审计性</strong>和<strong>可重复性</strong>。当生产环境出现问题时，你可以通过 Git 历史精确追溯到每一次基础设施变更，快速定位根因。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"terraform-基础\">Terraform 基础</h2><p>Terraform 是 HashiCorp 出品的多云基础设施编排工具，使用 HCL（HashiCorp Configuration Language）声明式定义云资源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"terraform init&#10;&#10;terraform plan&#10;&#10;terraform apply&#10;&#10;terraform destroy\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">terraform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">terraform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> plan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">terraform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apply</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">terraform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> destroy</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"基础示例\">基础示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"cat &gt; main.tf &lt;&lt; &#39;EOF&#39;&#10;terraform {&#10;  required_providers {&#10;    aws = {&#10;      source  = &quot;hashicorp/aws&quot;&#10;      version = &quot;~&gt; 5.0&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  backend &quot;s3&quot; {&#10;    bucket = &quot;my-terraform-state&quot;&#10;    key    = &quot;prod/terraform.tfstate&quot;&#10;    region = &quot;us-east-1&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;provider &quot;aws&quot; {&#10;  region = var.region&#10;}&#10;&#10;resource &quot;aws_vpc&quot; &quot;main&quot; {&#10;  cidr_block = &quot;10.0.0.0/16&quot;&#10;  tags = {&#10;    Name        = &quot;${var.project}-vpc&quot;&#10;    Environment = var.environment&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;resource &quot;aws_subnet&quot; &quot;public&quot; {&#10;  count             = 2&#10;  vpc_id            = aws_vpc.main.id&#10;  cidr_block        = cidrsubnet(aws_vpc.main.cidr_block, 8, count.index)&#10;  availability_zone = data.aws_availability_zones.available.names[count.index]&#10;}&#10;EOF\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main.tf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EOF'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">terraform {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  required_providers {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    aws = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      source  = \"hashicorp/aws\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      version = \"~> 5.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  backend \"s3\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    bucket = \"my-terraform-state\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    key    = \"prod/terraform.tfstate\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    region = \"us-east-1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">provider \"aws\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  region = var.region</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">resource \"aws_vpc\" \"main\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  cidr_block = \"10.0.0.0/16\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  tags = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    Name        = \"${var.project}-vpc\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    Environment = var.environment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">resource \"aws_subnet\" \"public\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  count             = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  vpc_id            = aws_vpc.main.id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  cidr_block        = cidrsubnet(aws_vpc.main.cidr_block, 8, count.index)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  availability_zone = data.aws_availability_zones.available.names[count.index]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EOF</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Terraform 工作流&#10;        INIT[terraform init&lt;br/&gt;初始化] --&gt; PLAN[terraform plan&lt;br/&gt;预览变更]&#10;        PLAN --&gt; REVIEW[人工审查]&#10;        REVIEW --&gt; APPLY[terraform apply&lt;br/&gt;执行变更]&#10;        APPLY --&gt; STATE[更新状态文件]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph Terraform 工作流\n        INIT[terraform init&lt;br/&gt;初始化] --&gt; PLAN[terraform plan&lt;br/&gt;预览变更]\n        PLAN --&gt; REVIEW[人工审查]\n        REVIEW --&gt; APPLY[terraform apply&lt;br/&gt;执行变更]\n        APPLY --&gt; STATE[更新状态文件]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Terraform 概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Provider</td>\n<td>云平台适配器</td>\n<td>aws, google, azure</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Resource</td>\n<td>基础设施资源定义</td>\n<td>aws_vpc, aws_subnet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Data Source</td>\n<td>查询已有资源</td>\n<td>aws_ami</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Variable</td>\n<td>输入变量</td>\n<td>var.region</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Output</td>\n<td>输出值</td>\n<td>vpc_id</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Module</td>\n<td>可复用的资源组合</td>\n<td>vpc-module</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>State</td>\n<td>资源状态映射</td>\n<td>terraform.tfstate</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"terraform-模块化\">Terraform 模块化</h2><p>模块（Module）是 Terraform 配置的复用单元，将常用的资源组合封装为可参数化的模块。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"cat &gt; modules/eks-cluster/main.tf &lt;&lt; &#39;EOF&#39;&#10;variable &quot;cluster_name&quot; {&#10;  type = string&#10;}&#10;&#10;variable &quot;node_count&quot; {&#10;  type    = number&#10;  default = 3&#10;}&#10;&#10;resource &quot;aws_eks_cluster&quot; &quot;main&quot; {&#10;  name     = var.cluster_name&#10;  role_arn = aws_iam_role.cluster.arn&#10;  vpc_config {&#10;    subnet_ids = var.subnet_ids&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;resource &quot;aws_eks_node_group&quot; &quot;workers&quot; {&#10;  cluster_name    = aws_eks_cluster.main.name&#10;  node_group_name = &quot;${var.cluster_name}-workers&quot;&#10;  scaling_config {&#10;    desired_size = var.node_count&#10;    max_size     = var.node_count * 2&#10;    min_size     = 1&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;output &quot;cluster_endpoint&quot; {&#10;  value = aws_eks_cluster.main.endpoint&#10;}&#10;EOF\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> modules/eks-cluster/main.tf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EOF'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">variable \"cluster_name\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  type = string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">variable \"node_count\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  type    = number</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  default = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">resource \"aws_eks_cluster\" \"main\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  name     = var.cluster_name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  role_arn = aws_iam_role.cluster.arn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  vpc_config {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    subnet_ids = var.subnet_ids</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">resource \"aws_eks_node_group\" \"workers\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  cluster_name    = aws_eks_cluster.main.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  node_group_name = \"${var.cluster_name}-workers\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  scaling_config {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    desired_size = var.node_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    max_size     = var.node_count * 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    min_size     = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">output \"cluster_endpoint\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  value = aws_eks_cluster.main.endpoint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EOF</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"cat &gt; environments/production/main.tf &lt;&lt; &#39;EOF&#39;&#10;module &quot;eks&quot; {&#10;  source       = &quot;../../modules/eks-cluster&quot;&#10;  cluster_name = &quot;prod-cluster&quot;&#10;  node_count   = 5&#10;  subnet_ids   = module.vpc.private_subnet_ids&#10;}&#10;EOF\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> environments/production/main.tf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EOF'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">module \"eks\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  source       = \"../../modules/eks-cluster\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  cluster_name = \"prod-cluster\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  node_count   = 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  subnet_ids   = module.vpc.private_subnet_ids</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EOF</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模块化策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础网络模块</td>\n<td>VPC, Subnet, NAT Gateway</td>\n<td>所有环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>K8s 集群模块</td>\n<td>EKS/GKE + 节点组</td>\n<td>集群部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库模块</td>\n<td>RDS + 安全组 + 参数组</td>\n<td>数据层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监控模块</td>\n<td>CloudWatch + 告警</td>\n<td>可观测性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ansible-配置管理\">Ansible 配置管理</h2><p>Ansible 是无代理的配置管理工具，通过 SSH 远程执行任务。适合服务器配置、应用部署和运维自动化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"---&#10;- name: 配置 Kubernetes Worker 节点&#10;  hosts: workers&#10;  become: true&#10;  tasks:&#10;    - name: 安装容器运行时&#10;      apt:&#10;        name:&#10;          - containerd&#10;          - apt-transport-https&#10;        state: present&#10;        update_cache: true&#10;&#10;    - name: 配置 containerd&#10;      copy:&#10;        src: files/containerd-config.toml&#10;        dest: /etc/containerd/config.toml&#10;      notify: restart containerd&#10;&#10;    - name: 加入 Kubernetes 集群&#10;      command: &#39;{{ kubeadm_join_command }}&#39;&#10;      when: not kubelet_configured&#10;&#10;  handlers:&#10;    - name: restart containerd&#10;      service:&#10;        name: containerd&#10;        state: restarted\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">配置 Kubernetes Worker 节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  hosts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">workers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  become</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tasks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">安装容器运行时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      apt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">containerd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apt-transport-https</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">present</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        update_cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">配置 containerd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      copy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        src</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">files/containerd-config.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        dest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/etc/containerd/config.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      notify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">restart containerd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">加入 Kubernetes 集群</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{{ kubeadm_join_command }}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      when</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">not kubelet_configured</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  handlers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">restart containerd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">containerd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">restarted</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    CTRL[控制节点&lt;br/&gt;Ansible] --&gt;|SSH| N1[Worker 1]&#10;    CTRL --&gt;|SSH| N2[Worker 2]&#10;    CTRL --&gt;|SSH| N3[Worker 3]\">graph LR\n    CTRL[控制节点&lt;br/&gt;Ansible] --&gt;|SSH| N1[Worker 1]\n    CTRL --&gt;|SSH| N2[Worker 2]\n    CTRL --&gt;|SSH| N3[Worker 3]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>IaC 工具</th>\n<th>适用层次</th>\n<th>状态管理</th>\n<th>学习曲线</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Terraform</td>\n<td>基础设施创建</td>\n<td>有状态</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ansible</td>\n<td>服务器配置</td>\n<td>无状态</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pulumi</td>\n<td>基础设施（通用语言）</td>\n<td>有状态</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CloudFormation</td>\n<td>AWS 基础设施</td>\n<td>有状态</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Terraform 和 Ansible 各有侧重且互补：Terraform 擅长云资源的创建和管理（VPC、EC2、RDS），Ansible 擅长服务器内部的配置和软件安装。典型的工作流是 Terraform 创建基础设施，Ansible 配置服务器。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"gitops-工作流\">GitOps 工作流</h2><p>GitOps 是 IaC 的进阶实践——以 Git 仓库作为基础设施和应用配置的唯一真实来源（Single Source of Truth），通过 Git 操作驱动部署。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    DEV[开发者] --&gt;|PR| GIT[Git 仓库&lt;br/&gt;基础设施代码]&#10;    GIT --&gt;|监听变更| ARGO[ArgoCD / Flux]&#10;    ARGO --&gt;|同步| K8S[Kubernetes 集群]&#10;    K8S --&gt;|状态反馈| ARGO&#10;    ARGO --&gt;|差异检测| ALERT[漂移告警]\">graph TD\n    DEV[开发者] --&gt;|PR| GIT[Git 仓库&lt;br/&gt;基础设施代码]\n    GIT --&gt;|监听变更| ARGO[ArgoCD / Flux]\n    ARGO --&gt;|同步| K8S[Kubernetes 集群]\n    K8S --&gt;|状态反馈| ARGO\n    ARGO --&gt;|差异检测| ALERT[漂移告警]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>GitOps 工具</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>同步方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ArgoCD</td>\n<td>UI 丰富、多集群支持</td>\n<td>Pull</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flux</td>\n<td>轻量、与 Git 深度集成</td>\n<td>Pull</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jenkins X</td>\n<td>完整 CI/CD + GitOps</td>\n<td>Push + Pull</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((基础设施即代码))&#10;    核心理念&#10;      声明式&#10;      版本控制&#10;      幂等性&#10;      可重复性&#10;    Terraform&#10;      多云支持&#10;      HCL 语法&#10;      状态管理&#10;      模块化&#10;    Ansible&#10;      无代理&#10;      SSH 执行&#10;      配置管理&#10;      运维自动化&#10;    GitOps&#10;      Git 唯一真实来源&#10;      ArgoCD&#10;      自动同步&#10;      漂移检测\">mindmap\n  root((基础设施即代码))\n    核心理念\n      声明式\n      版本控制\n      幂等性\n      可重复性\n    Terraform\n      多云支持\n      HCL 语法\n      状态管理\n      模块化\n    Ansible\n      无代理\n      SSH 执行\n      配置管理\n      运维自动化\n    GitOps\n      Git 唯一真实来源\n      ArgoCD\n      自动同步\n      漂移检测</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>IaC</strong> 将基础设施定义为版本化代码，实现可审计、可重复的基础设施管理。</li>\n<li><strong>Terraform</strong> 使用 HCL 声明式定义云资源，模块化设计实现配置复用。</li>\n<li><strong>Ansible</strong> 通过 SSH 无代理执行服务器配置，与 Terraform 互补。</li>\n<li>Terraform 负责基础设施创建，Ansible 负责服务器配置，是最佳组合。</li>\n<li><strong>GitOps</strong> 以 Git 为唯一真实来源，通过 ArgoCD/Flux 自动同步集群状态。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基础设施即代码","id":"基础设施即代码"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"IaC 核心理念","id":"iac-核心理念"},{"level":2,"text":"Terraform 基础","id":"terraform-基础"},{"level":3,"text":"基础示例","id":"基础示例"},{"level":2,"text":"Terraform 模块化","id":"terraform-模块化"},{"level":2,"text":"Ansible 配置管理","id":"ansible-配置管理"},{"level":2,"text":"GitOps 工作流","id":"gitops-工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"指标与告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/monitoring-and-operations/metrics-and-alerting"},"next":{"title":"事故响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/monitoring-and-operations/incident-response"}}